# School topics: {event} the label ("the Sports Festival", "Chocolate Day"), {eventline} with the day, {school} event/council/project/rumors, {evkind} what kind of event it is.

@rule me.school
on me.school
- [What do you think about {event}?|So, {event}...]
- [Heard anything about {event}?|How do you feel about {event}?]
- [Are you looking forward to {event}?|Got anything planned for {event}?]

@rule school.council
on school
when school=council
hook f_school_council
opens ask,agree,tease
- [The council race? {Eventline}.|Everyone's picking sides for the council.] [Who are you voting for?|It's getting intense.|I just want it to be over.]
- [Posters everywhere for the council race.|The council debate was something.] [Who are you backing?|Pretty heated.]
- [Council elections are a popularity contest.|I heard the council candidates are fighting.] [Change my mind.|Politics, even here.]

@rule school.project
on school
when school=project
hook f_school_project
opens ask,praise,invite
- [The club project? {Eventline}.|We're still working on the project.] [It's coming along.|We could use a hand, honestly.|I think it'll turn out well.]
- [The project is almost done.|The project's eating all our free time.] [Fingers crossed.|But it's worth it.]
- [We had a breakthrough on the project.|The project needs one more push.] [Finally.|Want to help?]

@rule school.plain
on school
hook f_school_plain
opens ask,share,tease
- [{Event}? I haven't thought about it much.|Oh, {event}.] [Should be interesting.|Everyone's talking about it.]
- [{Event}, huh?|Ah, right, {event}.] [Time flies.|People won't stop mentioning it.]

# ================= each calendar event for what it is (2026-11-01: "chocolate day [...] não é uma festa") =================
# {evkind}: gift (Chocolate Day), exam, sports, fair (Culture Festival), trip, wish (Tanabata), costume (Halloween), eve
# (Christmas Eve). A line under plain "school=event" must be true of all of them. Nobody "goes to" Chocolate Day.

@rule me.school.gift
on me.school
when evkind=gift
- [{Event} is coming, huh?|So, {event}...] [Are you making anything?|Homemade or store-bought?]
- [Is anyone getting chocolate from you?|Do you give chocolate on {event}?|Is your chocolate for everyone, or for one person?]
- [Who's lucky this year, on {event}?|Are you the kind to give friend chocolate on {event}?]

@rule me.school.exam
on me.school
when evkind=exam
- [Are you ready for {event}?|How's the studying going?|{Event} are close, huh?]
- [Have you started revising?|Which subject worries you most?]
- [Do you study alone or with friends?|Are you nervous about {event}?]

@rule me.school.sports
on me.school
when evkind=sports
- [Are you ready for {event}?|{Event} is coming up, huh?] [Which events are you in?|Are you running in the relay?]
- [Which team are you on for {event}?|Have you been training for {event}?]
- [Are you fast? For {event}, I mean.|Do you like {event}, or just put up with it?]

@rule me.school.fair
on me.school
when evkind=fair
- [Are you helping out at {event}?|Have you seen the stalls going up for {event}?]
- [{Event} is coming up, huh?] [Are you running a stall?|What shouldn't I miss?]
- [What's your class doing for {event}?|Will you show me around {event}?]

@rule me.school.trip
on me.school
when evkind=trip
- [Are you packed for {event}?|Looking forward to {event}?|Who are you sitting with on the bus?]
- [{Event} is coming up, huh?] [What are you bringing?|Is there anywhere you want to see?]
- [Who's in your group for {event}?|Bringing any snacks for {event}?]

@rule me.school.wish
on me.school
when evkind=wish
- [Have you written your wish for {event}?|What are you wishing for at {event}?]
- [{Event} is coming up, huh?] [Do you still hang up a wish?|Are you going to see the bamboo?]
- [Can I ask what you wished for at {event}?|Do you think wishes on {event} come true?]

@rule me.school.costume
on me.school
when evkind=costume
- [What are you going as for {event}?|Got a costume for {event}?]
- [{Event} is coming up, huh?] [Are you dressing up?|Do you do the whole costume thing?]
- [Scary or cute, for {event}?|Do you want help with your costume for {event}?]

@rule me.school.eve
on me.school
when evkind=eve
- [Any plans for {event}?|Who are you spending {event} with?]
- [{Event} is coming up, huh?] [Got plans?|Are you staying in?]
- [Do you do anything special for {event}?|Are you spending {event} with family?]

# ---------------- Chocolate Day ----------------
@rule school.gift.up
on school
when school=event evkind=gift mood=cheerful|flirty|none role!=teacher
feel smile
hook f_school_gift_up
opens ask,invite,tease
- [I've been melting chocolate all week.|My kitchen smells like cocoa.] [The first batch went in the bin.|It's harder than it looks.]
- [{Event}'s nearly here.|Only a few days till {event}.] [I still haven't decided who gets what.|I need more ribbon.]
- [Homemade or store-bought, that's the question.|I bought the good chocolate this year.] [I hope it turns out.|No pressure.]

@rule school.gift.low
on school
when school=event evkind=gift low=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_gift_low
opens comfort,ask,share
- [{Event}...|Ugh, {event}.] [I don't even know who I'd give any to.|Everyone keeps comparing who got what.]
- [I burned the chocolate again.|Every shop's sold out of the good stuff.] [I may just skip it this year.|Maybe a store-bought box will do.]

@rule school.gift.cool
on school
when school=event evkind=gift voice=cool|serious|proper role!=teacher
hook f_school_gift_cool
opens ask,agree,tease
- [{Event}. I've made a list.|I've got the courtesy chocolates sorted.] [Everyone gets the same box.|It's only polite.]
- [{Event} is mostly confectioners' marketing.|A whole day decided by a chocolate company.] [I'll still give some.|Don't read anything into it.]

@rule school.gift.staff
on school
when school=event evkind=gift role=teacher
hook f_school_gift_staff
opens ask,share,tease
- {classes}[My desk fills up with chocolate on {event}.|Every {event} a few students leave chocolate in the faculty room.] [The staff eat it by Friday.|I'm grateful, and heavier.]
- [{Event}? I buy one big box for the whole staff.|{Event} at my age is a shared box.] [Nobody gets their hopes up.|It's a very safe tradition.]

@rule school.gift.nurse
on school
when school=event evkind=gift job=nurse
hook f_school_gift_nurse
opens ask,tease,share
- [{Event} means stomach aches.|After {event} I see a lot of stomach aches.] [Too much chocolate, too fast.|Pace yourself, please.]
- [Every {event}, someone comes in with a burned finger.|Melted chocolate is hotter than it looks.] [Usually from the kitchen, not from love.|Run it under cold water.]

# ---------------- exams ----------------
@rule school.exam
on school
when school=event evkind=exam role!=teacher
feel worried
hook f_school_exam
opens comfort,invite,ask
- [Don't remind me about {event}.|Exams, exams, exams.] [Want to study together?|I'm so behind.|If I fail one more test...]
- [{Event} are coming and my brain is empty.|I keep dreaming about {event}.] [Save me.|Bad dreams.]
- [Did you start studying for {event}?|Only a few days till {event}.] [Please say no.|I'm panicking.]

@rule school.exam.ready
on school
when school=event evkind=exam voice=cool|serious|proper role!=teacher
hook f_school_exam_ready
opens ask,invite,agree
- [{Event}. I've made a revision schedule.|I've been through my notes for {event} twice.] [It should be fine.|Only two chapters left.]
- [{Event} are only a matter of preparation.|I started revising last week.] [Are you behind?|It's calmer that way.]

@rule school.teacher.exam
on school
when evkind=exam role=teacher
hook f_school_teacher_exam
opens ask,comfort,tease
- {classes}[I finished writing the exam last night.|The exam papers are locked in the faculty room.] [Don't ask.|I've said all I'm going to say.]
- {classes}[I've got a long week of grading ahead.|After {event}, I grade until my eyes close.] [Please write clearly.|Pity me.]
- [Are you asking about {event} to get out of studying?|Shouldn't you be revising?] [I know that trick.|Go on.]

@rule school.exam.nurse
on school
when evkind=exam job=nurse
hook f_school_exam_nurse
opens ask,share,comfort
- [Before {event}, half my visitors just haven't slept.|{Event} fill my beds.] [Nobody's sick. Everyone's tired.|Sleep is a study method too.]
- [Skip the energy drinks before {event}.|I've seen what all-nighters do.] [I'm serious.|Eat a real breakfast.]

# ---------------- sports festival ----------------
@rule school.sports.up
on school
when school=event evkind=sports mood=cheerful|flirty|none role!=teacher
feel smile
hook f_school_sports_up
opens invite,ask,tease
- [I signed up for the relay.|Our team's practicing every evening.] [We can't lose to the other department.|My legs hate me.]
- [{Event} is only a few days away.|Only a little longer till {event}.] [I hope the weather holds.|Are you cheering for my team?]

@rule school.sports.genki
on school
when school=event evkind=sports voice=genki|energetic|boyish|tough role!=teacher
feel laugh
hook f_school_sports_genki
opens invite,tease,ask
- [{Event}! I'm totally going to win!|{Event} is gonna be awesome!] [You'd better cheer for me!|Bet I beat you!]
- [I've been training for {event} all week!|{Event}! Finally!] [Watch me!|Let's goooo!]

@rule school.sports.low
on school
when school=event evkind=sports low=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_sports_low
opens comfort,invite,ask
- [They put me in the relay.|I got signed up for the three-legged race.] [I didn't even ask.|I'll fall. I know I'll fall.]
- [{Event}...|Ugh, {event}.] [I'm no good at sports.|Can I just hold the water bottles?]

@rule school.sports.club
on school
when school=event evkind=sports clubkind=sports role!=teacher
hook f_school_sports_club
opens ask,praise,invite
- [The {club} is expected to win at {event}.|The whole {club} is entered at {event}.] [No pressure at all.|We've doubled practice.]

@rule school.sports.staff
on school
when school=event evkind=sports role=teacher
hook f_school_sports_staff
opens ask,share,tease
- {classes}[I'm timing the races at {event}.|They've given me the whistle for {event}.] [Don't cheat. I can see you.|I've been told to look enthusiastic.]
- [{Event} means a day out in the sun for the staff too.|At {event} even the professors run.] [There's a professors' relay. Don't watch.|Don't laugh at my form.]

@rule school.nurse
on school
when evkind=sports job=nurse
hook f_school_nurse
opens ask,invite,share
- [{Event}? I'll be in the first aid tent.|{Event} means more bandages for me.] [Somebody has to be.|Try not to visit me.]
- [I look forward to {event}.|Everyone loves {event}.] [I just count the sprains.|Drink water, please.]

# ---------------- culture festival ----------------
@rule school.fair.up
on school
when school=event evkind=fair mood=cheerful|flirty|none role!=teacher
feel smile
hook f_school_fair_up
opens invite,ask,tease
- [{Event} is the best part of the term!|Yes! {Event}!] [I want to try every stall.|I've got a whole plan.]
- [Only a little longer till {event}.|I've been counting the days to {event}.] [We should walk around together.|Let's make it memorable.]

@rule school.fair.low
on school
when school=event evkind=fair low=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_fair_low
opens comfort,invite,ask
- [Everyone's so excited about {event}.|{Event}, huh.] [I just can't get into it.|Wake me up when it's over.]
- [{Event} again...|I forgot about {event}.] [I don't really feel like it.|Maybe I'll stay home.]

@rule school.fair.cool
on school
when school=event evkind=fair voice=cool|serious|proper role!=teacher
hook f_school_fair_cool
opens ask,agree
- [{Event}. It's well organized this year.|I've read the schedule for {event}.] [It should go smoothly.|Do you need the details?]
- [I'm helping organize {event}.|I'll attend {event}, of course.] [It won't be a problem.|It's expected.]

@rule school.event.club
on school
when school=event evkind=fair hasclub=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_event_club
opens ask,praise,invite
- [The {club} is doing something for {event}.|We've been preparing for {event} at the {club}.] [Come see us?|It's a lot of work.|I'm kind of nervous.]
- [The {club} has a booth at {event}.|We're putting on a show at {event}.] [Stop by!|Wish us luck.]

@rule school.fair.staff
on school
when school=event evkind=fair role=teacher
hook f_school_fair_staff
opens ask,invite,share
- {classes}[{Event}? I'm on the committee, of course.|Professors do most of the work for {event}, you know.] [Nobody asked me.|Don't ask about the budget.]
- [Ah, {event}. More forms to fill in.|{Event} means extra duty for me.] [I'll enjoy it from the sidelines.|You'd better behave.]

@rule school.fair.nurse
on school
when school=event evkind=fair job=nurse
hook f_school_fair_nurse
opens ask,tease,share
- [At {event} I treat burns from the takoyaki stall.|{Event} is all cuts from cardboard and hot oil.] [Every year.|Be careful with the stall tools.]

# ---------------- field trip ----------------
@rule school.trip.up
on school
when school=event evkind=trip mood=cheerful|flirty|none role!=teacher
feel smile
hook f_school_trip_up
opens ask,invite,tease
- [I've been packing for {event} for days.|My bag for {event} is already too heavy.] [Do I really need three books?|Better too much than too little.]
- [{Event} is close!|Only a few days till {event}.] [Who are you sitting with on the bus?|I want to see the old town.]

@rule school.trip.low
on school
when school=event evkind=trip low=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_trip_low
opens comfort,invite,ask
- [{Event}...|Ugh, {event}.] [I get sick on buses.|Hours on a bus with everyone.]
- [I still haven't paid the deposit for {event}.|I don't know who I'd room with on {event}.] [I may stay behind.|I'd rather not think about it.]

@rule school.trip.staff
on school
when school=event evkind=trip role=teacher
hook f_school_trip_staff
opens ask,share,tease
- {classes}[I'm a chaperone on {event}.|Guess who's counting heads on {event}.] [Don't get lost.|Please be on time for the bus.]
- [{Event} is a lot of paperwork for one bus ride.|I've booked every room for {event} myself.] [Be grateful.|Nobody thanks the planner.]

@rule school.trip.nurse
on school
when school=event evkind=trip job=nurse
hook f_school_trip_nurse
opens ask,share,tease
- [I'm packing the first aid bag for {event}.|If you get bus-sick on {event}, sit at the front.] [Tell me before it happens.|I've got pills.]

# ---------------- Tanabata ----------------
@rule school.wish.up
on school
when school=event evkind=wish mood=cheerful|flirty|none role!=teacher
feel smile
hook f_school_wish_up
opens ask,invite,tease
- [They've put up the bamboo for {event}.|I saw the bamboo out for {event}.] [I still have to write my wish.|It's already covered in paper strips.]
- [I've been thinking about my wish for {event}.|{Event}'s nearly here.] [I won't tell you what it is.|I hope it's a clear night.]

@rule school.wish.low
on school
when school=event evkind=wish low=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_wish_low
opens comfort,ask,share
- [I don't know what to wish for at {event}.|{Event}...] [Nothing I write ever comes true.|It's just paper on a stick.]

@rule school.wish.staff
on school
when school=event evkind=wish role=teacher
hook f_school_wish_staff
opens ask,tease,share
- {classes}[I read the wishes on the bamboo for {event}.|Half the wishes for {event} are about passing my class.] [Paper won't help you.|Study instead.]
- [Even the faculty room has a bamboo for {event}.|I hung up a wish for {event} too.] [Don't ask what I wrote.|It involves a long holiday.]

# ---------------- Halloween ----------------
@rule school.costume.up
on school
when school=event evkind=costume mood=cheerful|flirty|none role!=teacher
feel smile
hook f_school_costume_up
opens ask,invite,tease
- [I've got my costume for {event}!|I'm still sewing my {event} costume.] [You won't recognize me.|Don't peek.]
- [{Event} is so close.|Only a little longer till {event}.] [I bought far too much candy.|You'd better dress up too.]

@rule school.costume.low
on school
when school=event evkind=costume low=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_costume_low
opens comfort,invite,tease
- [I don't have a costume for {event}.|{Event}, huh.] [I'll go as a tired person.|Everyone else looks so good.]

@rule school.costume.staff
on school
when school=event evkind=costume role=teacher
hook f_school_costume_staff
opens ask,tease,share
- {classes}Please don't wear your {event} costume to my class. I can't grade a vampire. Candy?
- {classes}I'm told a professor must dress up for {event}. [Have a candy while I think.|Take a candy. I'm still deciding.]
- [Someone left a bag of {event} candy on my desk.|{Event}, and the faculty room is full of candy.] [Have one. I've still got a costume to find.|Take some. I've got to find a costume.]

# ---------------- Christmas Eve ----------------
@rule school.eve.up
on school
when school=event evkind=eve mood=cheerful|flirty|none role!=teacher
feel smile
hook f_school_eve_up
opens ask,invite,tease
- [{Event} is nearly here.|Only a few days till {event}.] [I've ordered a cake.|I still need to buy presents.]
- [Everyone's making plans for {event}.|Have you seen the lights in town?] [It really feels like winter now.|I hope it snows.]

@rule school.eve.low
on school
when school=event evkind=eve low=yes role!=teacher
hook f_school_eve_low
opens comfort,invite,share
- [{Event}...|Ugh, {event}.] [I'll probably spend it alone.|All those couples in town.]
- [I've got no plans for {event}.|Everyone's got someone for {event}.] [It's fine.|It's just another night.]

@rule school.eve.staff
on school
when school=event evkind=eve role=teacher
hook f_school_eve_staff
opens ask,share,tease
- {classes}[I'm spending {event} with a stack of papers.|My plans for {event} involve grading.] [Very romantic.|Don't look at me like that.]
- [The staff always go out for {event}.|{Event}, and I still have work.] [Nobody talks about it the next day.|Such is the life.]
